CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'jd->jd_jid != sdp->sd_lockstruct.ls_jid'
#37: FILE: fs/gfs2/recovery.c:459:
+	if (sdp->sd_args.ar_spectator ||
+	    (jd->jd_jid != sdp->sd_lockstruct.ls_jid)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

